        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "          79 Heic Kandic Khou Apanty Luai Guangpui",
            "                             12. 12.12.6. Ref. 6. 6.12.8. 6",
            "          Doh hei E",
            "",
            "          1. Heic kandic khou apanty luai guangpui nungc kiu",
            "             Kahym daihmei Ravguangc ta ariu pwni the",
            "             Ataanv guayna Kahu khoutei lyan pwni the",
            "             Kamei nthuihlou khang.",
            "",
            "                      Nzianmei Ravguangc rui (2)",
            "                      Nzianmei rui ti-nthuihlou khang khwan bame",
            "                      Tingkauh hymdaihmei kandic khou",
            "                      Gut khang 'diulou pwni",
            "",
            "          2. Kunghmei nzianmei nunc guay tat rey ngam kan the",
            "             Tingkauh ramgai tuai dat makmei ramc khou gut khang",
            "             Tingsaeng zaengna tingkauh Salem khou ai ruan ni",
            "             Guangh pwan piulou lana.",
            "",
            "          3. Heicdi nritmei cross tei ai phungc ngam ni cho ?",
            "             Paapc tuang ric tei tingmik kathuih adow sihnic",
            "             Hymdaihmei Ravguangc ta thuanhpui khwan rui suan ni",
            "             Ai Emmanuel ta.",
            "",
            "          4. Kandih hei zauc pwki ai neihlaa khang maek ge.",
            "             Zinghmei ruina gumliamna bampui ramc khouhei",
            "             Kumsihnic ngammei Ravguangc Jisu zanc khourui",
            "             Ngammei khou ai bam ni."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
